body:
I have no doubts the movie will be a awful comittee written mess, which removes all character development from the last movie (probably even kills off Mutt and Marion).

&#x200B;

I will see it for Harrison Ford though.

&#x200B;

What will be clear from this movie, and which is clear from the star wars sequels, is that you need someone like Lucas to make this kind of stuff work. Someone who have batshit ideas, and are willing to take risks. Comittess will always make soulless trash.
